                "main_topic": [
                  {
                    "h_title": "Kearns, NSW 2558",
                    "main_title": "Custom Carports & Outdoor Pergolas in Sydney",
                    "author": "Vogue Pergolas",
                    "language": "en",
                    "level": 4,
                    "primary_content": [
                      {
                        "text": "Vogue Pergolas Sydney was established in 2005 as a natural expansion of the company, following the success of our initial Canberra business. Based in Moorebank in Western Sydney, Vogue Pergolas Sydney is geographically positioned to service all parts of Sydney.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "From Cronulla to the Northern Beaches, from Camden to Windsor and also the Blue Mountains \u2013 there is no area too remote for the Vogue Pergolas team.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Since its commencement, Vogue Pergolas Sydney has firmly established itself as one of the leading pergolas and other shade structure suppliers, in the region. We have designed and installed thousands of unique, custom-made pergolas, carports, awnings, patios and pool & spa covers, with each one enhancing the homes, businesses and lives of countless Sydneysiders.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Our commercial clients in the region include KFC, Hungry Jacks and Coca-Cola, in addition to the dozens of Sydney Schools who proudly display their Vogue Pergola.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Vogue Pergolas Sydney regularly exhibits at local home and leisure shows including the HIA Sydney Home Show, Hills Home Show & Lifestyle Expo and the Sydney Caravan, Camping & RV Holiday Supershow. Such trade shows afford prospective clients the opportunity to view one of our custom-designs first hand, and further discuss their specific requirements with one of our expert design engineers.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Darren Ettridge heads our Vogue Pergolas Sydney office. As a qualified builder with more than 8 years of hands-on building experience, Darren specialises in decks and pergolas. Upon completing a stint overseas honing his construction skills, he returned to Australia where he was contracted to assist with the refurbishment of the \u201cSpirit of Tasmania\u201d, and renovating several pubs and clubs around Sydney.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Darren is a passionate outdoor entertainer, relishing the memories created with family and friends. Creating such outdoor living areas, bringing together other families and friend, keeps him passionate and enthusiastic about the unique Vogue Pergola-product.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      }
                    ],
                    "secondary_content": null,
                    "table_content": null
                  },
                  {
                    "h_title": "What is a carport?",
                    "main_title": "Custom Carports & Outdoor Pergolas in Sydney",
                    "author": "Vogue Pergolas",
                    "language": "en",
                    "level": 3,
                    "primary_content": [
                      {
                        "text": "A carport is a covered structure used to protect vehicles from the\nelements. Carports can be attached to a house or garage, or they can\nbe free-standing.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "They are usually made of metal or wood, and they often have a\nconcrete or asphalt floor. In some cases, carports can also be used\nto store other items, such as boats, RVs, or lawn equipment.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Carports are an affordable way to protect your vehicles from the\nsun, rain, snow, and hail. They can also extend the life of your car\nby keeping it cool in the summer and preventing it from rusting in\nthe winter.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "If you live in an area with severe weather conditions, a carport can\nalso provide peace of mind knowing that your car is safe from high\nwinds and heavy rains.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Carports are available in a variety of sizes and styles to suit any\nbudget or aesthetic preference. Whether you need a small carport for\none car or a large carport for multiple vehicles, you can find what\nyou\"re looking for at Vogue Pergolas Sydney.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "We offer a wide selection of carports in Sydney, including flat roof\ncarports, gable roof carports, and dutch gable carports.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "We also offer pergolas in Sydney to give your outdoor space an\nelegant makeover. Contact us today to learn more about our carport\noptions and get a free quote!",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      }
                    ],
                    "secondary_content": null,
                    "table_content": null
                  },
                  {
                    "h_title": "What are the benefits of a custom carport?",
                    "main_title": "Custom Carports & Outdoor Pergolas in Sydney",
                    "author": "Vogue Pergolas",
                    "language": "en",
                    "level": 3,
                    "primary_content": [
                      {
                        "text": "Carports and pergolas provide a great way to protect your car from\nthe elements. Carports in Sydney are especially useful, as they\noffer protection from the sun and rain.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "They can also be used to store other outdoor equipment, such as\nbicycles and lawn chairs. Pergolas in Sydney offer a more elegant\nsolution for car protection.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "They can be made from a variety of materials, including wood,\naluminum, and PVC. Pergolas can also be customised to match the\nstyle of your home.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "If you\"re looking for a carport or pergola that will give your car\nthe best possible protection, then custom carports and pergolas in\nSydney are the way to go.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      }
                    ],
                    "secondary_content": null,
                    "table_content": null
                  },
                  {
                    "h_title": "How can I keep my car cool in summer?",
                    "main_title": "Custom Carports & Outdoor Pergolas in Sydney",
                    "author": "Vogue Pergolas",
                    "language": "en",
                    "level": 3,
                    "primary_content": [
                      {
                        "text": "As the weather gets hotter, we all start to feel the heat -\nespecially when we\"re stuck in a car. If you're looking for ways to\nkeep your car cool this summer, there are a few things you can do.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Carports and pergolas in Sydney can provide some welcome shade for\nyour car, and they can also help to keep it cooler by deflecting\ndirect sunlight.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "You might also want to consider tinting your windows, which can help\nto reduce the amount of heat that enters the car.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Finally, make sure you keep your car clean and free of clutter, as\nthis will help to maximise airflow and keep the car cooler.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "By following these simple tips, you can keep your car cool all\nsummer long with a shade carport in Sydney.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      }
                    ],
                    "secondary_content": null,
                    "table_content": null
                  },
                  {
                    "h_title": "Who creates the best carports in Sydney?",
                    "main_title": "Custom Carports & Outdoor Pergolas in Sydney",
                    "author": "Vogue Pergolas",
                    "language": "en",
                    "level": 3,
                    "primary_content": [
                      {
                        "text": "For the ultimate new pergola and outdoor living area - choose Vogue\nPergolas Sydney.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "We\"ve been designing and installing carports and pergolas in Sydney\nfor over 20 years, and we know how to create a functional and\nstylish addition to any home.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "We create our outdoor pergolas in Sydney using the highest quality\nmaterials, and our team of experienced professionals can handle any\nsize or type of project.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "If your outdoor area includes a swimming pool or timber decks, then\nour team will be happy to work around these existing features.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "From the creation of your custom carport designs to the completion\nof your new carport, Our pergola builders specialise in creating the\nperfect outdoor space.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Our pergola design and pergola roofing is durable, sturdy and built\nto last, making our projects the best custom carports in Sydney.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "So choose the pergola builders Sydney homeowners trust. Contact our\ncarport builders for a free consultation.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Plus, we offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee on all of our Sydney\npergolas. So if you're looking for carports in Sydney that are built\nto last, give us a call today.",
                        "url": null,
                        "urls": null
                      }
                    ],
                    "secondary_content": null,
                    "table_content": null
                  }
                ],
